# Planned-Later Capture

## Triggers

When the user or plan says: "plan later", "backlog", "implement later", "not for now", "defer", or "out of scope for this sprint".

## Action

1. Create or append `docs/plans/backlog/<slug>.md` using the template in `docs/plans/backlog/README.md`
2. Update `docs/plans/README.md` backlog index if new
3. **Do not** implement the deferred scope on the current branch

## Slug naming

Use kebab-case matching the feature (e.g. `observability-sentry-logging.md`).

## Promotion

When work is ready, promote per `docs/plans/backlog/README.md` — create a `.cursor/plans/` child plan before coding.
